    "The messy part was the long stretch of losing. A closer can collect saves and still spend most seasons with no meaningful September. Franco also battled injuries and eventually lost the closer job as younger arms appeared. Instead of becoming distant, he stayed involved, moved into a leadership role, and accepted the captaincy because teammates trusted him.",
