    "The Mets moved him before his reputation reached its full size, and that made the later All-Star closing seasons elsewhere feel like a missed chance. It is easy to judge the move from the future, but the Mets were constantly trying to balance a loaded roster against the next contract and the next need. Myers became the name fans used when discussing how much talent the team let leave.",
